# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in. NEVER commit real keys.

# Merriam-Webster Elementary Dictionary (sd2) API key.
# Used by `npm run enrich` to bake audio/pronunciation/definitions into the
# bundled word lists at build time. Get one at dictionaryapi.com.
DICTIONARY_API_KEY=

# The same key is set as a Netlify environment variable (Site settings ->
# Environment variables -> DICTIONARY_API_KEY) so the runtime dictionary proxy
# can look up words parents add. It is never shipped to the browser.

# Google Cloud Vision key for Listen & Write handwriting OCR is ALSO a Netlify
# env var only (GOOGLE_VISION_KEY), never here and never in the client.
